# sweep: --seed-root examples/books/fixtures/chapters
# The place at the foot of the page, on The Lock Keeper's Year, a sample of
# four short chapters with a contents list. A page given the whole panel says
# nothing. With the bar kept, every page says which it is and how many are
# left in its chapter, and the line keeps its own size when the type of the
# book is made larger.
wait-for Lock Keeper
tap The Lock Keeper
wait-for Spring
expect-missing Page 1 of
shot books-place-whole-page
tap-id reader-controls
wait-for Page 1 of
tap-id reader-full-page
wait-idle
expect Page 1 of 8
expect 1 page left in the chapter
shot books-place
page next
wait-for Page 2 of 8
expect Last page of the chapter
shot books-place-chapter-end
page next
wait-for Page 3 of 8
expect Summer
expect 1 page left in the chapter
# A notice takes its room from the words, and the place stays under it.
page back
page back
wait-for Page 1 of 8
page back
wait-for This is the first page.
expect Page 1 of 8
shot books-place-notice
# Larger type makes more pages of the same chapter, and the line under them
# is the size it was.
tap-id reader-controls
wait-for 100%
tap-id reader-size-5
wait-for 110%
tap-id reader-size-1
wait-for 120%
tap-id reader-size-6
wait-for 130%
tap-id 4294967295
wait-idle
expect Page 1 of 12
expect 2 pages left in the chapter
shot books-place-larger
# Giving the page the whole panel takes the line away with the bar.
tap-id reader-controls
tap-id reader-full-page
wait-idle
expect-missing left in the chapter
expect-missing Aa
